# sys-gym-canalave (docs/research/gym-puzzles.md): Canalave Gym's 24 lifts.
# A completed step onto a platform's tile at its height rides it (Field_ProcessStep): its bit in the saved
# set flips at once; a lift carries the player 8 units a tick between floors (height calculation off), a
# horizontal platform walks the player WALK_FASTER to its other end. The player's collision is the floor's
# authored mask. The route (a shortest walk over those rules from the authored start) rides 13 platforms to
# Byron on the fourth floor; trainers battle from where they spot the player (a player on another floor is
# not seen: objects collide within 2 height units). A save round trip on the third floor keeps the floor
# and every bit; leaving after Byron and coming back sets the start arrangement again. The game seed is
# pinned (`set state seed`) so the turning worker faces the same way on every run seed.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_INFERNAPE 80 platinum:MOVE_FLAMETHROWER platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_FIRE_PUNCH
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_EMPOLEON 80 platinum:MOVE_SURF platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_ICE_BEAM platinum:MOVE_HYDRO_PUMP
set state seed 4242
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY_GYM 16 26 up
until idle
